# Product Vision

Read `docs/PRODUCT_VISION_V3.md` before any Mission work.

## Rule

> **기능을 구현하지 말고, 사용자의 경험을 구현하라.**

## When It Applies

Every implementation, polish, and QA pass in Mission Mode (M1–M13).

## Requirements

- North Star: 3-minute first project · daily reopen (Morning Brief, Confidence, Decision)
- Landing: storytelling only — no feature lists, tech specs, or card grids
- Journey: single primary CTA per screen · AI leads · Thinking UX on wait
- Workspace: AI PM tone — Today, Coach, Decision — not dashboard widgets
- Ship: build → QA → commit → push → tag → next Mission (no approval questions)

## Examples

```tsx
// ✅ One CTA, AI recommendation copy
<Button>프로젝트 시작</Button>

// ❌ Feature grid on Landing
<LandingFeatures cards={[...12 items]} />
```
